('srd35_magic_crystal_ball_with_telepathy','Crystal ball with telepathy','magic_item',70000,70000,'Listed in Table: Major Wondrous Items; market price 70,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"70,000 gp","roll_result":"53","raw_table_row":["53","Crystal ball with telepathy","70,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_horn_of_blasting_greater','Horn of blasting, greater','magic_item',70000,70000,'This horn functions as a horn of blasting, except that it deals 10d6 points of sonic damage, stuns creatures for 1 round, and deafens them for 4d6 rounds (a DC 19 Fortitude reduces the damage by half and negates the stunning and deafening). Crystalline objects take 16d6 points of sonic damage as described for the horn of blasting. A greater horn of blasting also has a 20% cumulative chance of exploding.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"70,000 gp","roll_result":"54","raw_table_row":["54","Horn of blasting, greater","70,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_pearl_of_power_two_spells','Pearl of power, two spells','magic_item',70000,70000,'Listed in Table: Major Wondrous Items; market price 70,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"70,000 gp","roll_result":"55","raw_table_row":["55","Pearl of power, two spells","70,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_helm_of_teleportation','Helm of teleportation','magic_item',73500,73500,'A character wearing this device may teleport three times per day, exactly as if he had cast the spell of the same name.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"73,500 gp","roll_result":"56","raw_table_row":["56","Helm of teleportation","73,500 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_gem_of_seeing','Gem of seeing','magic_item',75000,75000,'This finely cut and polished stone is indistinguishable from an ordinary jewel in appearance. When it is gazed through, a gem of seeing enables the user to see as though she were affected by the true seeing spell. A gem of seeing can be used for as much as 30 minutes a day, divided up into periods of minutes or rounds as the user sees fit.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"75,000 gp","roll_result":"57","raw_table_row":["57","Gem of seeing","75,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_robe_of_the_archmagi','Robe of the archmagi','magic_item',75000,75000,'This normal-appearing garment can be white (01–45 on d%, good alignment), gray (46–75, neither good nor evil alignment), or black (76–100, evil alignment). Its wearer, if an arcane spellcaster, gains the following powers.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"75,000 gp","roll_result":"58","raw_table_row":["58","Robe of the archmagi","75,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_mantle_of_faith','Mantle of faith','magic_item',76000,76000,'This holy garment, worn over normal clothing, grants damage reduction 5/evil to the character wearing it.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"76,000 gp","roll_result":"59","raw_table_row":["59","Mantle of faith","76,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_crystal_ball_with_true_seeing','Crystal ball with true seeing','magic_item',80000,80000,'Listed in Table: Major Wondrous Items; market price 80,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"80,000 gp","roll_result":"60","raw_table_row":["60","Crystal ball with true seeing","80,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_pearl_of_power_9th_level_spell','Pearl of power, 9th-level spell','magic_item',81000,81000,'Listed in Table: Major Wondrous Items; market price 81,000 gp. The specific item entry is not individually written out in this SRD table.','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"81,000 gp","roll_result":"61","raw_table_row":["61","Pearl of power, 9th-level spell","81,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":false}'::jsonb),
('srd35_magic_well_of_many_worlds','Well of many worlds','magic_item',82000,82000,'This strange, interdimensional device looks just like a portable hole. Anything placed within it is immediately cast to another world—a parallel world, another planet, or a different plane (chosen randomly). If the well is moved, the random factor again comes into play. It can be picked up, folded, or rolled, just as a portable hole can be. Objects from the world the well touches can come through the opening just as easily as from the initiating place. (It is a two-way portal.)','https://github.com/olimot/srd-v3.5-md/blob/main/magic-items/magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md','wondrous_items','{"source_file":"magic-items-v-wondrous-items.md","source_table":"Table: Major Wondrous Items","market_price":"82,000 gp","roll_result":"62","raw_table_row":["62","Well of many worlds","82,000 gp"],"source_dataset":"olimot/srd-v3.5-md","license":"Open Game Content / OGL 1.0a","has_full_item_description":true}'::jsonb),
